     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A long vowel takes two beats and can change the meaning.",
     "texto": [
      "In hiragana, a long vowel can be written with another vowel: おおきい has おお. Read both beats; don't reduce them to one.",
      "おおきい いえ です。 (It's a big house.)",
      "おおきい ねこ が います。 (There's a big cat.)"
